    "claim_rule": "A held-out improvement claim requires frozen Brain to exceed both contemporaneous memoryless and placebo arms by a predeclared margin with all guards intact.",
    "sample_size_note": "The proposed design is approximately 35 evaluation runs per arm. It is deliberately not authorized in Phase 7 calibration."
